\code{"cosine"} is \verb{A_ij / sqrt(D_i D_j)}, \code{"jaccard"} is
\code{A_ij / (D_i + D_j - A_ij)}, \code{"inclusion"} is \code{A_ij / min(D_i, D_j)} and
\code{"equivalence"} is \verb{A_ij^2 / (D_i D_j)} (van Eck & Waltman 2009).

The pairwise network of topics is the projection of the topic
combinations that \code{\link[=group_hypergraph]{group_hypergraph()}} builds from the same topic model,
